-- Para 9(3): exercisable in accordance with the instructions or interests of any group undertaking (s 1161(5), a seam).
-- exercisable in accordance with the instructions or interests of that undertaking, which is a group undertaking (s 1161(5) answers JUST TRUE)
#ASSERT (`sch 7 para 9(3) the rights are treated as exercisable in accordance with the instructions or in the interests of the undertaking` WITH `the rights are exercisable in accordance with the instructions of, or in the interests of, that undertaking` IS TRUE, `s 1161(5) the undertaking is a group undertaking in relation to the other undertaking` IS JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
